## 📌 About the Project

A **line editor** is a simple text editor that works with one line at a
time using commands and line numbers.

This project implements a command-line line editor in **C** that allows
users to create and modify a small text document directly from the terminal.

The project focuses on applying fundamental C programming concepts such as:

- Data structures
- Functions
- Strings
- Dynamic memory allocation
- Arrays and pointers
- Command-line input handling

---

## ✨ Features

### 🔴 Insert a Line

Insert text at any valid line number.

```text
insert <line_number> <text>
